# module, which hyphen asks about a hyphen. 4.3's named a hyphen at the end
# of a word or at the start of any word but the first, so parola- was parola
# trattino d'unione, where 6.1 says nothing for it. A screen reader that
# sends a mark's name with the mark kept after it, as NVDA does, was heard
# naming it twice.
